# gpt-oss:20b as an LLM judge, sized for a 16 GB card (RTX 5070 Ti).
#
# Weights are ~13.8 GB. At 16K context the KV cache adds roughly 1 GB, so the
# whole thing sits in 16 GB VRAM with a little headroom. Do NOT raise num_ctx
# without checking `ollama ps` afterwards: once the split stops reading
# 100% GPU, throughput falls off a cliff.
#
# 16K is chosen from the judge prompts themselves, which run ~1.2K tokens for a
# single code and ~3K for a 5-code bag. 16K is already generous; the reason not
# to shrink further is that a truncated prompt fails SILENTLY.
#
#   ollama create gpt-oss-judge -f Modelfile.gpt-oss-judge

FROM gpt-oss:20b

PARAMETER num_ctx 16384
PARAMETER temperature 0
